  "harness": "src/accuracy.js (simulateDraft, scoreLeague, roundRobin, startersPoints) — imported, not copied. World, cell, bootstrap, placebo perturbation and resampled pool are VERBATIM from scripts/band-lab.mjs, which takes them verbatim from h2h-lab.mjs.",
